nswertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "gt", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> על שפת העיגול <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f=0\\)</span>. בדקו אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g(0)\\)</span> מוגדר.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "maxv", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "Rsq", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> זהו הערך המקסימלי של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span>. צריך עוד להציב אותו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span> היא פונקציה עולה, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(h=g(f)\\)</span> מקסימלית בנקודה שבה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> מקסימלית. מצאו את המקסימום של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> והציבו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(g\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["R", "Rsq", "cc", "f", "fsq", "g", "gt", "isclosed", "isopen", "maxv", "p0", "q0"], "nvariants": 50}